                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "mutation"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Executes a mutation function that performs transactional writes to the Convex database. The function is identified by its module path and export name. Named arguments are passed as a JSON object. Mutations are atomic and strongly consistent. Returns the function's return value and any console log output produced during execution."
